OL,4,CCar bomb tears through Colombian city  
OL,5,Cwounding more than 20                  
OL,6,GA car bomb has exploded in the central 
OL,7,GColombian city of Villavicencio,       
OL,8,Ginjuring at least 23 people.           
OL,10,FThe explosive device was detonated in  
OL,11,Ffront of the offices of the regional   
OL,12,Fgovernment, in the city centre,        
OL,13,Fdamaging several buildings.            
OL,15,FNo group has so far admitted carrying  
OL,16,Fout the attack - the latest in a       
OL,17,Fseries using explosives to target      
OL,18,Fofficial buildings and security        
OL,19,Fforces' headquarters.                  
